<title>UK: Oseberg to load equiv 42.2 standard cargoes in Apr.</title>
<headline>Oseberg to load equiv 42.2 standard cargoes in Apr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Oseberg crude system is due to load the equivalent of 42.2 standard cargoes of 500,000 barrels each in April, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the programme consisted of 28 cargoes of 600,000 barrels, three cargoes of 500,000 barrels, one cargo of one million barrrels and one of 1.8 million barrels, totalling 33 actual loadings.  </p>
<p>The Oseberg system was scheduled to load the equivalent of 46 standard 500,000-barrel stems in March, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
